      "body": "Apply through the Philadelphia Tax Center or use the paper application on the program page. You do not need an online account.\n\n- Apply by September 30 each year. If you missed the deadline and are already 65 or older, ask Revenue about backdated enrollment.\n- Include copies of proof of age and income for yourself and your spouse, as applicable. Keep your original documents.\n- If you qualified in an earlier year, ask Revenue which year's income documents to provide."
